==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 35.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,060f~1,100f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 35.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,060f~1,100f</sup>.
**10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Units that outrange the Master A. are useful but not required, due to his low magnifications. The other enemies give large amounts of money, so expensive, spammable units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] can be used freely. If any of them do create pressure, normal meatshielding along with [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|Backliners]] can be used.

If long ranged-cats are not owned, or if the stage just needs to be beaten as quickly as possible, fast units like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can be used to simply rush in and kill everything quickly.

